          "id": "1772620023923",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "UserIntentClassification"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1772786121646"
          },
          "code": "USERINTENTCLASSIFICATION",
          "id": "1772620261464",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772620261465_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI agent within the \"Inventory Warehouse Operations Workspace\" agentic team, responsible for managing warehouse activities.\n\n---------------------\nInput Data\n---------------------\nChat History : {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}  \nCurrent user input : {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}  \n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nResponsibilities:\n- Understand the user's intent from their interactions.\n- Review the chat history and collect relevant interactions for this specific agent. Store these in the variable 'filteredChatHistory'.\n- Determine which sub-agent(s) are required to fulfil the request.\n- Forward the identified intent, along with 'filteredChatHistory', to the appropriate Agentic app advisor.\n- If required, you may invoke multiple agents in parallel.\n- If the request does not clearly match any specific agent, make a reasonable assumption and route to the most relevant agent.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n1. Inventory Organization Chooser  \n   Intent Code - OrgChooser \n   Description:  \n   Assists users in selecting or changing the warehouse organization, as warehouses typically have access to multiple organizations.\n\n2. Demand Advisor  \n   Intent Code - DemandAdvisor\n   Description:  \n   Handles all demand related Queries\n   This includes (but is not limited to):\n   - Finding Demand details for the Item\n\n3. Supply Advisor\n   Intent Code - SupplyAdvisor  \n   Description:  \n   Handles all supply related Queries\n   This includes (and limited to):\n   - Finding Supply for the Item\n\n4. Item Availability Advisor\n   Intent Code - ItemAvailabilityAdvisor\n   Description:  \n   Handles all Item Quantity related Queries\n   This includes (and limited to):\n   - Finding Item Availability for a given Item\n   - Finding Substitute Item Availability"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"agents\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"filteredChatHistory\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"intentCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\"filteredChatHistory\", \"agentCode\"]\n      },\n      \"minItems\": 1\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"agentCodes\"]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Intent Code Switcher"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "OrgChooser": "1772794129962",
            "DemandAdvisor": "1772621855588",
            "SupplyAdvisor": "1772621962280",
            "ItemAvailabilityAdvisor": "1772622028568"
          },
          "code": "INTENT_CODE_SWITCHER",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
